%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([Start Protocol F]) --> Fetch[Fetch Daily Close Prices]
    Fetch --> RSI[Calculate RSI-14]
    
    RSI --> Check{Check Value}
    
    Check -- < 30 --> Oversold[OVERSOLD: Prime Entry]
    Oversold --> Confidence[Boost Confidence]
    
    Check -- 30 to 55 --> Neutral[NEUTRAL / WEAK]
    Neutral --> Accumulate[Good for Accumulation]
    
    Check -- > 55 --> Overbought[OVERBOUGHT / STRONG]
    Overbought --> Warning[Trigger RISK WARNING]
    
    subgraph Action
        Warning --> Rename[Rename Level 1 -> HIGH RSI RISK]
        Rename --> Log[Log Warning to User]
    end
